g raids on Allied shipping during that time. In 3 years members of the flotilla single handedly managed to sink or disable 5 Allied warships and 20 merchant ships. The La Decima units also earned a good reputation fighting on the frontline against the Allies at Anzio and on the Gothic Line.","LocalizedString":"The Decima Flottiglia MAS, also known as La Decima, was an Italian flotilla of the Regia Marina that specialized in commando raids. The flotilla was composed of specially trained frogmen and used Manned Torpedoes, Explosive Motorboats and frogmen to carry out their raids. La Decima was active from 1941 to 1943 and participated in numerous daring raids on Allied shipping during that time. In 3 years members of the flotilla single handedly managed to sink or disable 5 Allied warships and 20 merchant ships. The La Decima units also earned a good reputation fighting on the frontline against the Allies at Anzio and on the Gothic Line."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Breakthrough","isInPermanentPool":true,"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Ambush","EHelpBubbleTypes::Guard","EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment"],"hasDeployment":true,"hasAmbush":true,"hasGuard":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion02'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/StarterContent/Audio/Explosion02.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Italy/t_italian_poster.t_italian_poster","SubPathString":""},"ImageAnchor":"EImageAnchor::Top","artist":"Italian WWII Poster","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/Decima_Mas.Decima_Mas","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":418.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_unit_la_decima_photo","SourceString":"A Decima MAS Frogman, date unknown.","LocalizedString":"A Decima MAS Frogman, date unknown."},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"NiagaraSystem'NS_ExplosionInfantryS'","Obje